<section class="panel"><h1>Journey test data</h1>
<p class="note"><strong>LOCAL TEST</strong> · Fictional registered users and equipment. Verification codes appear below. No SMS is sent. Use the sign-in page and retrieve a test OTP below to test role-based journeys. This page uses test data only.</p>
<p><%= link_to "Sign in and test journeys", sign_in_path, class: "button-link primary" %></p><h2>Registered test users</h2>
<% @accounts.each do |account| %><p><strong><%= account.display_name %></strong> · <%= number_to_phone(@mobile_numbers[account.id].to_s.delete_prefix("+1"), area_code: true) %> · <%= account.public_locality %> · <%= AccountRole.where(account_id: account.id).pluck(:role).join(", ") %> · <%= account.status %></p><% end %>
<h2>Seeded equipment — current status</h2>
<p>Each donor has five categories. Moderator publication and requests create synthetic screening and policy records for this local test environment only; these are not production approvals. No real documents are collected.</p>
<% @listings.each do |listing| %><% revision = ListingRevision.find(listing.current_revision_id) %><article class="panel"><h3><%= revision.title %></h3><p><%= listing.donor.display_name %> · <%= listing.status.humanize %> · <%= revision.offer_kind == "loan" ? "Loan until #{revision.loan_until}" : "Free to keep" %></p></article><% end %>
<h2>SMS Messages inbox</h2><p>Most recent first. These are local records, not delivery confirmations.</p>
<% @messages.each do |message| %><article class="panel"><strong>TEST · <%= message.recipient %></strong><p><%= sms_message_body(message.body) %></p><small><%= message.created_at %></small></article><% end %>
</section>
